# PAN SDK execution contract

- Read root AGENTS.md and STATE.md before modifying source.
- Treat PLAN.md and docs/research/Building a Sovereign Digital Nation.md as
  directional canon. Do not invent a replacement architecture.
- Preserve PAN as a production-grade monolith. Do not introduce microservices,
  distributed infrastructure, or scaffolding folders to simulate progress.
- Work at the owning implementation seam. Do not add wrappers, shims, proxies,
  alternate packages, or duplicate logic to avoid a direct integration.
- Nation pillars already exist: PAN_SDK/treasury.py, PAN_SDK/email_social.py,
  PAN_SDK/master_db.py. Edit those owners; do not recreate them beside the
  monolith.
- Thyris is telecommunications (phone orchestration, VMs as phones/relays).
  It is not AIPC. Phones do not contain in-device AI. Do not pull, invent, or
  dummy core.prompt_bridge / PromptSystemBridge.
- USMS (memory.unified_memory_system, Ed25519 immune DAG) is not Thyris VM
  memory (memory.memory_core / memory.system_cache). They coexist in memory/.
  Do not create a memory_system package and do not wrap one to look like the
  other.
- Security owns security/sovereign_firewall.py. Erebus cognition is
  security/planetary_immune_system.py binding USMS to PAN RSA packets. Do not
  collapse PAN RSA identity and USMS Ed25519 identity.
- A material architecture decision requires options and evidence before selection:
  package layout, persistence semantics, protocol/service boundary, deployment,
  external communications, publication, secrets, or destructive action.
- A mechanical defect may be repaired directly when the existing contract is
  clear; run the relevant consumer path afterward.
- Never claim success from a plan, static check, old log, or unexecuted command.
  Separate pre-existing baseline failures from introduced failures.
- Preserve unrelated working-tree changes and historical evidence.
- Next justified action is the real SovereignInferenceEngine._run_inference
  owner (finish-prior inside already-landed treasury Proof-of-Inference).
  Present local-model/runtime options before writing code; do not dummy the
  owner. qemu-img / qemu-system-x86_64 plus an Android image is a later
  host-tool frontier after that owner is selected and landed, not a co-equal
  next unit. prompt_bridge is rejected, not next work. Do not expand
  master_db §6.2.
